---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import promptV1 from '../prompts/write-like-pj-v1.md?raw';

// The changelog grows as the prompt evolves; newest first. Each version's
// prompt file lives in src/prompts/ so old posts can link the exact version
// that generated their AI draft.
const versions = [
  {
    version: 'v1',
    date: 'August 2026',
    notes: 'First version. Banned AI vocabulary and structures, plus voice rules distilled from nine years of my blog posts and older email.',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="How I Write | Pachev Joseph"
  description="How AI fits into my writing, and the evolving prompt I use to draft in my own voice."
>
  <article class="how-i-write">
    <h1>How I write</h1>

    <p>
      Some posts here start as my raw notes, get drafted by an AI, and then get
      edited by me until they say what I actually mean. I think readers deserve
      to see that pipeline instead of guessing about it, so posts that had AI
      help carry a badge and a three-way toggle: the <strong>final</strong>
      version you'd normally read, <strong>my notes</strong> it started from,
      and the <strong>AI draft</strong> in between, verbatim. Posts without the
      toggle were written entirely by hand.
    </p>

    <p>
      The drafts come from a prompt that tries to keep the machine out of my
      voice. It bans the usual AI tells and describes how I actually write. It
      evolves as I catch new slop patterns, and every version is kept so each
      post can point at the exact prompt that produced its draft.
    </p>

    <h2>The prompt</h2>

    <div class="prompt-box">
      <div class="prompt-header">
        <span class="prompt-version">v1 · current</span>
      </div>
      <pre><code>{promptV1}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h2>Changelog</h2>

    <ul class="changelog">
      {versions.map(v => (
        <li>
          <strong>{v.version}</strong> <span class="changelog-date">({v.date})</span>: {v.notes}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .how-i-write {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .how-i-write h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .how-i-write h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .prompt-box {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .prompt-header {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .prompt-version {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .prompt-box pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .changelog {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .changelog li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .changelog-date {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
